***********************************************************
* SD15C - Littelfuse SD-C series 450 W bidirectional TVS diode, SOD-323
*
* BEHAVIORAL model, fitted to the Littelfuse SD-C datasheet (Rev 09/27/16).
* Littelfuse's own SPICE models for this family are not publicly downloadable.
*
* Datasheet (25 C)                      Model
*   VRWM              15 V
*   VBR  @ 1 mA       16.7 V min        ~18.4 V
*   ILEAK @ 15 V      1 uA max          ~0.4 uA
*   VC @ 1 A  (8/20)  24 V max          ~22.3 V
*   VC @ 10 A (8/20)  31 V max          ~30.3 V
*   C @ 0 V, 1 MHz    75 pF max         75 pF (37 pF @ 12 V)
*
* Symmetrical: two anti-series junctions (MID is internal). Not modelled:
* self-heating during a surge, temperature dependence, ESD/TLP turn-on.
*
* Pins match the KiCad symbol: 1 = A1, 2 = A2
***********************************************************
.SUBCKT SD15C A1 A2
D1 MID A1 DSD15C
D2 MID A2 DSD15C
.MODEL DSD15C D
+ IS = 1E-12  N = 1  RS = 0.39
+ BV = 17.9  IBV = 1M  NBV = 16
+ CJO = 150P  VJ = 0.7  M = 0.4  FC = 0.5
+ TT = 0  EG = 1.11  XTI = 3
.ENDS SD15C
